flowchart LR
    A["FORMAT 1<br/>Operator Login<br/><small>Badge ID + PIN<br/>Role and session</small>"] --> B["FORMAT 2<br/>Kit QR Validation<br/><small>Kit ID, batch, expiry<br/>VALID / EXPIRED</small>"]
    B --> C["FORMAT 3A<br/>Reaction Timer<br/><small>Kit protocol<br/>Capture window</small>"]
    C --> D["FORMAT 3B<br/>Guided Camera Capture<br/><small>Reference card + kit<br/>Blur / glare gates</small>"]
    D --> E["FORMAT 4<br/>Card Calibration<br/><small>Six patches + gain<br/>CARD VALID / INVALID</small>"]
    E --> F["FORMAT 4B<br/>Sample Analysis<br/><small>ROI + LAB<br/>Delta E + confidence</small>"]
    F --> G["FORMAT 5<br/>Evidence Record<br/><small>SHA-256 + hash chain<br/>Signature + export</small>"]
    G --> H["FORMAT 6/7/8<br/>Verify and Review<br/><small>History + retest<br/>Supervisor + verify.html</small>"]

    A -.-> A1["PIN / biometric<br/>operator_id + role"]
    B -.-> B1["Kit metadata<br/>batch + expiry + status"]
    C -.-> C1["Timer state<br/>in_window + elapsed_s"]
    D -.-> D1["Quality gate<br/>blur + glare + exposure"]
    E -.-> E1["Reference DB<br/>versioned thresholds"]
    F -.-> F1["Classification<br/>Positive / Negative / Inconclusive"]
    G -.-> G1["Offline-first<br/>PENDING / SYNCED / FAILED"]
    H -.-> H1["Legal checklist<br/>BNSS / NDPS / BSA references"]

    H --> Z["PRESUMPTIVE FIELD RESULT + TAMPER-EVIDENT DIGITAL RECORD<br/><small>Laboratory confirmation remains required</small>"]

